# Two spells' messages. Smokegod (60) blesses a dagger (3020) and identifies it: "Adds bless object flag." ended in
# a bare \n, where identify's other lines end in \n\r (#78; the affect and weapon-flag lines beside it were the
# same). Then Decimus (10, given 30000 hit points) carries a small sword (3021) without wearing it, and Smokegod
# casts heat metal at him until it burns: "You drop a small sword before it burns you." (stock said "You and drop").
@connect dec
Decimus
psswrd
@return
@return
@connect god
Smokegod
smoke123
@return
@return
set skill smokegod all 100
set char smokegod mana 30000
restore smokegod
@obj 3020 3001
get dagger
cast bless dagger
@pulse 24
cast identify dagger
@pulse 24
@obj 3021 3001
set char decimus hp 30000
restore decimus
@as dec
get sword
@as god
cast 'heat metal' decimus
@pulse 24
cast 'heat metal' decimus
@pulse 24
cast 'heat metal' decimus
@pulse 24
